{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "en",
  "language_raw": "English",
  "source": "message/dat/English/script/s1_sub_003.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/English/script/s1_sub_003.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_woman_01",
      "hash64": "C9E4B2545526920B",
      "text": "Ooohohoho! Ooohohoho![VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_woman_02",
      "hash64": "C9E4B354552693BE",
      "text": "Oh, the positive energy is positively flowing!\\nI’d just love to buy up all this Kitakami air![VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_man_01",
      "hash64": "F2AB8B2F8DFAEDE5",
      "text": "That’s my dearest O’Nare! Even while out in the\\nboonies, your ideas are still purely metropolitan![VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_woman_03",
      "hash64": "C9E4B45455269571",
      "text": "I do appreciate your willingness to speak\\nthe truth, Billy![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_man_02",
      "hash64": "F2AB882F8DFAE8CC",
      "text": "So, my dearest O’Nare! However shall we waste\\nour time and our money today?[VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_woman_04",
      "hash64": "C9E4B55455269724",
      "text": "How, indeed...[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_woman_05",
      "hash64": "C9E4B654552698D7",
      "text": "Billy, look—a commoner! They’re staring at us...[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_man_03",
      "hash64": "F2AB892F8DFAEA7F",
      "text": "Eh? A commoner?[VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_man_04",
      "hash64": "F2AB862F8DFAE566",
      "text": "Why yes, your eyes do not decieve you—that\\nthere is almost certainly a commoner![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_woman_06",
      "hash64": "C9E4B75455269A8A",
      "text": "As I live and breathe—a commoner! A living,\\nbreathing commoner![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_woman_07",
      "hash64": "C9E4B85455269C3D",
      "text": "Wh-whatever do we do, Billy?! Is it bad manners\\nto ask to shake their hand? Is it acceptable to\\r\\nask for an autograph?![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 121,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_man_05",
      "hash64": "F2AB872F8DFAE719",
      "text": "Collect yourself, my dear O’Nare! No need to\\nrush. Look! This commoner isn’t going anywhere![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_woman_08",
      "hash64": "C9E4A954552682C0",
      "text": "My apologies... It’s not every day that I come\\nface-to-face with a commoner, you see.[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_man_06",
      "hash64": "F2AB842F8DFAE200",
      "text": "Naturally—you’re the president of Paldea Realty,\\nafter all![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_woman_09",
      "hash64": "C9E4AA5455268473",
      "text": "Excuse me? Yes, you—commoner![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_woman_10",
      "hash64": "C9E837545529A9E1",
      "text": "Would you be so kind as to indulge me in a duel\\nwith your Pokémon?[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_woman_11",
      "hash64": "C9E836545529A82E",
      "text": "If you can defeat me, I will grant you riches\\nbeyond your wildest imagination![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_man_07",
      "hash64": "F2AB852F8DFAE3B3",
      "text": "Th-there it is! O’Nare’s favorite pastime—[VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_man_11",
      "hash64": "F2AF0F2F8DFE0408",
      "text": "throwing the common folk a bone![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_woman_12",
      "hash64": "C9E835545529A67B",
      "text": "Ohoho... Please come see me once you’re ready,\\ndear commoner.[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_man_npc",
      "hash64": "F67D01CCEA4BEA0D",
      "text": "If you want the great fortune O’Nare offered,\\nyou should go speak to her, dear commoner.[VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_woman_13",
      "hash64": "C9E834545529A4C8",
      "text": "Will you duel me for riches beyond your wildest\\nimagination?[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_woman_14",
      "hash64": "C9E83B545529B0AD",
      "text": "You know, I think I quite like it when a commoner\\ntells me no now and then...\\c\\nBut the time of a Glitterati is exceedingly\\nvaluable! We will have this battle RIGHT NOW![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 170,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_woman_15",
      "hash64": "C9E83A545529AEFA",
      "text": "I, O’Nare—the president of Paldea Realty—will\\ncrush you, commoner![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_man_08",
      "hash64": "F2AB922F8DFAF9CA",
      "text": "Pfwee, pfwee! Go get ’em, O’Nare![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_woman_16",
      "hash64": "C9E839545529AD47",
      "text": "You’re really something! A commoner a cut\\nabove the rest![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_man_09",
      "hash64": "F2AB932F8DFAFB7D",
      "text": "Pfwee, pfwee! Not even defeat can eclipse your\\nbeauty, O’Nare![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_woman_17",
      "hash64": "C9E838545529AB94",
      "text": "Now listen to me, commoner: the most important\\nthing about money is how you use it.[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_woman_18",
      "hash64": "C9E82F5455299C49",
      "text": "Spend that reward on something meaningful—an\\ninvestment in yourself.[VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_woman_19",
      "hash64": "C9E82E5455299A96",
      "text": "That way, you’ll continue to sparkle, even when\\nyour money is gone![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_woman_20",
      "hash64": "C9EBBD54552CC36A",
      "text": "Come now, dear Billy! I think I’d quite like to go\\nsee [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]that waterfall[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] in Paldea![VAR 0x0114(0041)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0041"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_man_10",
      "hash64": "F2AF102F8DFE05BB",
      "text": "Pfwee! We’ve only just arrived in Kitakami, yet\\nnow we’re returning home! You really are an\\r\\nexemplary Glitterati![VAR 0x0114(0040)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 116,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0040"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_secretary_01",
      "hash64": "41BDAD190E24DAE7",
      "text": "Oh, my dear Mr. Billy and Lady O’Nare... Where\\nin the world are you?",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "s1_sub_003_secretary_02",
      "hash64": "41BDAE190E24DC9A",
      "text": "Lady O’Nare said something about a place with a\\nview of the bountiful fields of the countryside...\\r\\nbut where is that?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
